          "id": "world-trump-xi-putin-iran-apec-2026-11-09",
          "headline": "Trump says he will raise Iran war with Xi and Putin at next week's APEC summit",
          "summary": "US President Donald Trump says he expects to talk to China's Xi Jinping and Russia's Vladimir Putin at next week's APEC summit about the war on Iran and 'denuclearisation'. Secretary of State Marco Rubio said on Sunday the sides are not near a breakthrough and called some of Iran's demands 'outrageous and ridiculous'.",
