          "headline": "Sheikh Hasina applies for passport, signalling plan to return to Bangladesh",
          "summary": "Bangladesh's ousted prime minister Sheikh Hasina, who has lived in India for two years, has asked for a new passport and ID card so she can return home. She told Reuters she plans to surrender before a Bangladeshi court, which sentenced her to death in absentia last year over the 2024 protest crackdown. Her aides say a date will be set once formalities are done.",
